to do something good honestly.

1301
01:32:05.868 --> 01:32:09.535
My husband used
to drive an ambulance.

1302
01:32:10.618 --> 01:32:14.452
He was saving money.

1303
01:32:15.660 --> 01:32:20.202
He wished to start his
own ambulance service.

1304
01:32:23.202 --> 01:32:24.602
He used to say,

1305
