1538
01:49:03.178 --> 01:49:05.370
and changed forever.

1539
01:49:07.618 --> 01:49:11.545
And that day Babloo became RJ.

1540
01:49:12.884 --> 01:49:14.130
Ms. Startled.

1541
01:49:14.755 --> 01:49:16.547
